Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Hi everyone,

I'm using readModels to extract the modification indices from a multi-group graded response model. However, mod_indices does not contain the modification indices for the individual thresholds. For example, in my Mplus output:

Means/Intercepts/Thresholds

[ NARQ1    ]                      24.991     0.215      0.215        0.178

[ NARQ3    ]                      23.250    -0.297     -0.297       -0.202

[ NARQ5    ]                      78.514     0.404      0.404        0.336

[ NARQ16   ]                      44.555    -0.911     -0.911       -0.334

[ NARQ1$1  ]                       7.538    -0.143     -0.143       -0.119

[ NARQ1$2  ]                       2.882    -0.109     -0.109       -0.091

[ NARQ1$3  ]                       5.636    -0.163     -0.163       -0.135

[ NARQ1$4  ]                       3.380    -0.108     -0.108       -0.089

With readModels, only the modification indices for the item intercepts are extracted, but not the ones for the individual thresholds (NARQ1$1 - NARQ1$4). Is there any way to obtain the modification indices for the thresholds within MplusAutomation?

Any help with this would be greatly appreciated!

Best wishes,

Eunike

