Hi Nick,

Using your second example (All_Output), I don't know what "ModelParameters" is inside the function. That should still be "All_Output". Also, in retrospect, you should use lapply, not sapply, though this should not make a difference in general:

combined <- do.call(dplyr::bind_rows, lapply(1:length(All_Output), function(m) {

      df <- All_Output[[m]]$parameters$unstandardized
      df$model <- names(All_Output)[m]
      return(df)
    }))

Michael

